### 0. 健康检查（服务是否存活）
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### 1. 创建渠道
POST http://localhost:8080/api/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DeepSeek 主",
  "provider": "deepseek",
  "base_url": "http://localhost:9090/v1",
  "api_key": "sk-test-123",
  "weight": 1
}

### 2. 渠道列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/channels

### 3. 创建第二个渠道（测多条 + 中文）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/channels
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "OpenAI 备用",
  "provider": "openai",
  "base_url": "https://api.openai.com/v1",
  "api_key": "sk-test-456",
  "weight": 2
}

### 4. 渠道详情（把 3 换成真实 id）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/channels/3

### 5. 更新渠道（把 3 换成真实 id；测 0/false 也能更新成功）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/channels/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DeepSeek 主-改",
  "provider": "deepseek",
  "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1",
  "api_key": "sk-new-key-999",
  "weight": 0,
  "enabled": false
}

### 6. 删除渠道（把 3 换成真实 id）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/channels/10

### 7. 删除不存在的渠道（应返回 404）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/channels/999

### 8. AI 网关统一入口（第 4 步：转发到渠道上游）
# 前置：渠道的 base_url 指向 mock 上游（http://localhost:9090/v1）
# 先开 mock：go run ./cmd/mockupstream，再调下面接口
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "mock-upstream",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "你好，网关在吗？"}
  ]
}

### 9. 网关 SSE 流式（打字机效果）
# 前置：mock 上游正在运行（go run ./cmd/mockupstream）
# 用 curl -N（不缓冲）才能看到逐块输出；REST Client 会等流结束再显示
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "mock-upstream",
  "stream": true,
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "来一段流式回复"}
  ]
}
